10. Compatibility and Fallback

To minimize integration risk, the existing Story pipeline remains available as a fallback mechanism.

Fallback scenarios include:

- Unsupported formats
- Format analysis failure
- MotionScrap processing failure

Workflow:

MotionScrap
      │
      ▼
Validation
      │
 ┌────┴────┐
 │ Pass    │ Fail
 ▼         ▼
Merge   Story Pipeline

This guarantees backward compatibility while allowing MotionScrap to optimize supported scenarios.

---

11. Conclusion

MotionScrap introduces a hybrid merge architecture that combines direct transfer, transition rendering and selective transcoding.

